            "GitHub (GitHub, Inc., United States): your GitHub id, username, profile address and picture, the name and bio you show on GitHub, your follower and public repository counts, and up to 12 of your own public repositories with the most stars (no forks or archived ones), each with its name, description, main language and stars. At first we pick the 3 with the most stars; you choose up to 6 of them to show.",
