          "When your account is erased, we delete: your email address, password, two-factor settings, month and year of birth and the age log, your sessions and push subscriptions, your profile (display name, pronouns, picture, banner, status, bio, links, section choices, decorations, effect), your linked accounts and our copies of them, your settings, the messages you sent, the Servers and bots you own, your memberships and friends list, and any copy of your data you asked for. Your designs, published or not, and their files go too, and they leave everyone using them. The Discover listings of your Servers and bots end with them.",
